## The Concept

An enterprise agentic system capable of executing multi-step reasoning, validating sandboxed tool calls, and streaming structured thought loops directly to the client interface.

### Technical Achievements

- Implemented real-time token streaming over secure WebSockets with zero client lag.
- Built a fault-tolerant state machine in Redis for multi-tenant background task queues.
